{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121660","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121660/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121660/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121660/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121660","id":4954525919,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ1AQ3w","number":121660,"title":"Godot does not complain about _init with args on Resource when a var is present","user":{"login":"blockninja124","id":64211894,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MjExODk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64211894?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockninja124","html_url":"https://github.com/blockninja124","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockninja124/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockninja124/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockninja124/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockninja124/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockninja124/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockninja124/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockninja124/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockninja124/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blockninja124/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-07-23T01:23:55Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T13:17:10Z","closed_at":"2026-09-04T13:17:07Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Not reproducible in 4.5.1-stable (the error logs properly)\n- Not reproducible in 4.6.2-stable (the error logs properly)\n- Reproducible in 4.7-stable\n- Reproducible in 4.7.1-stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - Linux Mint 22.1 (Xia) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 (nvidia; 595.71.05) - AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 31.24 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf you override `_init` in a type that extends `Resource`, and add an argument to `_init`, normally godot will complain at runtime:\n\n<img width=\"1233\" height=\"24\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4a440eda-d1a9-4e66-8498-940fbd7000ad\" />\n\nHowever if you also add a typed `var` property to your type that extends `Resource`, the error goes away and instead the player instantly closes on launching the game.\n\n<img width=\"634\" height=\"77\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aabce641-192a-4938-a02e-30298ba5039d\" />\n\n---\n\nWorks fine:\n```gdscript\nclass_name Type extends Resource\nfunc _init() -> void:\n\tpass\n```\n```gdscript\nclass_name Type extends Resource\nvar t: int\nfunc _init() -> void:\n\tpass\n```\n\nCauses the error to be logged (correct behaviour):\n```gdscript\nclass_name Type extends Resource\nfunc _init(arg: int) -> void:\n\tpass\n```\n```gdscript\nclass_name Type extends Resource\nvar t\nfunc _init(arg: int) -> void:\n\tpass\n```\n\nDoes not cause the error to be logged, silently closes the game:\n```gdscript\nclass_name Type extends Resource\nvar t: int\nfunc _init(arg: int) -> void:\n\tpass\n```\n\n---\n\nA demonstration of what I mean by \"silently closes\":\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7bf49f2f-ae90-46c4-9220-7fb03036536b\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Make a script with a `class_name` that extends `Resource`. Lets call it `Type`\n- Override `_init` in `Type`, add an extra arg\n- Add a typed variable to `Type`, e.g. `var t: int`\n\nTo make godot actually try to load the Resource, you also need to:\n- Attach another script to a node, in that script `@export` a var of type `Type`\n- In the inspector, instantiate a value for the property\n- Launch the scene\n- The player instantly closes, no errors.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bug-repro.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30288596/bug-repro.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121660/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121660/timeline","performed_via_github_app":nu